      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LAGRANGE (3) finds it hard to win but looks close to breaking through. Has finished in the placings two on end now, the latest when third (22.52) at this track. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Overdue and expected to feature again. REBORN DILEMMA (8) was in traffic last time at this course and distance and fell. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Can do much better this time. KILKENNY BOY (2) placed in a Grade 5 when a neck second this course and distance last time in a personal Best Time (22.32) and also clocked one of the quickest times on the card. Strong latest and expected to measure up. CREEPING SAILOR (4) has ability and can find the frame.",
